# Merge these into the site's EXISTING _redirects, before broader matches.
# Replace this hostname with the provisioned HTTPS API origin. Do not deploy the
# placeholder hostname until its DNS, certificate, API, and health check work.
/moon-astra/api/*  https://moon-astra-api.ai-civ.com/api/:splat  200!

